# Generated knowledge graph. 43 MB across ~200 files, including dated snapshots
# and a local cache, and `graphify update .` regenerates it from the source that
# is already tracked here. The merge driver named in .gitattributes only applies
# if this is ever tracked deliberately.
graphify-out/

# Loose Hostinger MCP config: contains a live API token inline
hostingermcp.json

# Expo writes a bare {"expo": {}} here when an `expo` or `eas` command is run
# from the repository root instead of from mobile/. It is not configuration —
# the mobile app is configured by mobile/app.config.ts — and its presence makes
# the root register as a second, phantom Expo project: `expo install` run inside
# mobile/ then resolves the project root upward and writes dependencies to the
# root package.json, which is how expo-updates landed in the wrong workspace.
#
# Ignored so it stops reappearing in `git status`. Deleting it is still the fix;
# ignoring only stops it being committed by mistake.
/app.json
